          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "If\n$u(t)=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}\u2061t\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$v(t)=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\\end{aligned}]$\nare solutions to ${x}^{\u2032}(t)=Ax(t),$ find $Aw(t)$ where\n$w(t)=[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t-\\operatorname{cos}\u2061t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}\u2061t+\\operatorname{sin}\u2061t\\end{aligned}].$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
