      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-21112",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "If ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066703/assets/32e9cba3d7ee75019489dcc8a9c82f1b854bfa77af49e22fa9f51d4412cba95d.png) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066703/assets/dc64b0c557c838cf31e652ebdb8eee91d1fee8c947b343b16fceaf765c1f8517.png) are solutions to $\\mathbf{x}'(t)=A\\mathbf{x}(t),$ find $A\\mathbf{w}(t)$ where ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066703/assets/64b157c381c05102b51320592e61ffff5c4d611af4bd15679f1f2b38f3d01b10.png)",
